  <Docs>
    <summary>Provides a callback for validation of ZIP entry paths.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>The default callback accepts all entry paths. Use <see cref="M:Dalvik.SystemInterop.ZipPathValidator.SetCallback(Dalvik.SystemInterop.ZipPathValidator.ICallback)" /> to install custom validation, such as checks for components that can cause path traversal. This class does not reject such paths by default.</para>
      <para>See the <format type="text/html"><a href="https://android.googlesource.com/platform/libcore/+/de876a01b29230b877c9f408348c38a90ee724a5/dalvik/src/main/java/dalvik/system/ZipPathValidator.java">Android ZipPathValidator source</a></format>.</para>
    </remarks>
  </Docs>
