      <Docs>
        <param name="callback">The non-null callback that validates ZIP entry paths.</param>
        <summary>Sets the callback used to validate ZIP entry paths.</summary>
        <remarks>
          <para>The callback must only validate the path. It should not perform input/output or other blocking operations. A typical callback checks the entry name in one pass and throws <see cref="T:Java.Util.Zip.ZipException" /> if the path contains potentially hazardous components, such as <c>..</c>.</para>
          <para>See the <format type="text/html"><a href="https://android.googlesource.com/platform/libcore/+/de876a01b29230b877c9f408348c38a90ee724a5/dalvik/src/main/java/dalvik/system/ZipPathValidator.java">Android setCallback source</a></format>.</para>
